In my fantasy, I always thought I would slap someone, make a big speech, and storm out forever.
在我的幻想中，我一直以为我会扇某人一巴掌，发表一番长篇大论，然后永远地摔门而去。

62
00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:47.900
But this is good, too.
不过这样也挺好。

63
00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:48.720
Hmm.
嗯。

64
00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:49.780
All right.
好吧。

65
00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:50.220
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

66
00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:53.180
So that was actually my candy bag alt.
所以那其实是我的糖果袋备选镜头。

67
00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.860
My candy bag alt made it into the episode.
我的糖果袋备选镜头最终播出了。

68
00:02:55.860 --> 00:03:00.580
The original talking head that was in the shooting draft actually said this.
拍摄剧本里的原本那个访谈镜头其实是这么说的。

69
00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.140
It's a blessing in disguise.
这可以说是因祸得福。

70
00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.780
