所以我希望这种情况现在能停下来。

73
00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:12.900
I like that.
我喜欢这个。

74
00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:13.540
Me, too.
我也是。

75
00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:18.420
So finally, we got this letter from Harshita V that said,
所以最后，我们收到了哈希塔·V发来的这封信，上面写着：

76
00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:21.940
Not a question, but something I thought you might like.
不是一个问题，但我觉着你们可能会喜欢。

77
00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:28.220
Over the course of the entire nine seasons, Stanley and Creed only talk to each other once.
在整整九季的过程中，斯坦利和克里德只说过一次话。

78
00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:30.820
And they only say four words to each other.
而且他们只对彼此说了四个字。

79
00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:34.540
And that happens during this episode, Branch Closing.
而这发生在这一集《分公司倒闭》中。

80
00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:37.260
Lady, did you know that was a thing?
老姐，你知道有这回事吗？

81
00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:38.580
I Googled it.
我搜过了。

82
00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:39.480
I looked everywhere.
我到处都查过了。

83
00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:45.720
There are threads on Reddit that are all about how Stanley and Creed never speak to one another.
Reddit上有好些帖子都在讨论斯坦利和克里德从不说话这件事。

84
00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:47.760
I did not realize that.
我之前没意识到这一点。

85
00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:50.660
But now I'm trying to play scenes in my head.
但现在我正在脑海里回放那些场景。

86
00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:54.000
And even though sometimes they're sort of in proximity to one another,
而且尽管有时候他们离得挺近的，

87
00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.900
they're not really interacting.
他们其实并没有什么互动。

88
00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:56.460
You're right.
你说的对。

89
00:03:56.460 --> 00:04:01.120
Yeah, so there is a scene in Fun Run where they're interacting.
对，所以在《趣味长跑》里有一幕他们是有互动的。

90
00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:06.760
They have gone off the course with Oscar, and they're having lunch together, Oscar, Creed, and Stanley.
他们和奥斯卡一起偏离了路线，在一起吃午饭，奥斯卡、克里德和斯坦利。

91
00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:07.020
Yeah.
对。

92
00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.180
They don't have any lines to one another.
他们之间没有任何台词。

93
00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:12.940
So they're all seated at the table, but they don't share any dialogue.
所以他们都坐在桌旁，但没有任何对话。

94
00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:20.300
So I thought that in honor of their only time saying words to one another, maybe we should hear it.
所以我想为了纪念他们唯一一次对彼此开口说话，也许我们应该听听看。

95
00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:20.720
Yeah.
好。

96
00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:22.080
It's from this episode.
就是出自这一集。

97
00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:25.800
Stanley has a talking head where he says he's excited about the branch closing.
斯坦利有一个访谈镜头，他说他很高兴分公司要倒闭了。

