101
00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:39.160
Feeling nostalgic?
怀旧了吗？

102
00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:41.620
Yeah, nostalgic.
对，挺怀旧的。

103
00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:43.800
