312
00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:17.180
However, very often, Jim would have a talking head all the time, and his talking heads had a window to the world behind him.
然而，吉姆的单人访谈镜头却很常见，他的单人访谈背景是一扇通往外面世界的窗户。

313
00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:18.040
Yes.
是的。

314
00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:21.980
And the point of that was because he had a future outside of this company.
这样做的用意是，因为他在这个公司之外有未来。

315
00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:22.620
Yes.
没错。

316
00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:22.740
Right?
对吧？

317
00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:23.940
He was going places.
他是前途无量的。

318
00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:24.740
Yes.
是的。

319
00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:32.980
Angela, in this episode, after the employees get the news that Dunder Mifflin Scranton is closing,
安吉拉，在这集里，当员工们得知邓德米弗林斯克兰顿分公司要关闭的消息后，

