00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:29.020
It's subtle, but it's layered and it's there.
它很微妙，但很有层次感，而且确实存在。

340
00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:32.620
Everybody watch branch closing again just for the talking head.
大家为了单人访谈再去重看一遍《分公司关闭》吧。

