401
00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:33.620
So Dwight thinks he is getting faxes from his future self.
所以德怀特以为他收到了来自未来自己的传真。

402
00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:35.400
This is classic gym.
这太吉姆了。

403
00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:36.140
It's so good.
太棒了。

404
00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:36.740
It's so good.
太棒了。

