00:48:47.140 --> 00:48:49.380
He appeared in eight episodes of the show.
他在这部剧中出演了八集。

1031
00:48:49.500 --> 00:48:51.600
He did a weird pilot with Rainn Wilson.
他曾和雷恩·威尔森拍过一部奇怪的试播集。

1032
00:48:52.040 --> 00:48:52.400
Yes.
