00:49:00.720 --> 00:49:01.340
him a little bit.
他简单聊了聊。

1036
00:49:01.560 --> 00:49:02.100
All right.
好的。

1037
00:49:02.260 --> 00:49:03.540
We're so excited to have him here.
我们很高兴能邀请到他。

1038
00:49:03.660 --> 00:49:04.500
Let's play the interview.
让我们播放这段采访。

1039
00:49:09.170 --> 00:49:09.970
Hey, Chip.
嘿，奇普。

1040
00:49:09.970 --> 00:49:11.870
Ain't no party like a Scranton party.
斯克兰顿的派对无与伦比。

1041
00:49:12.250 --> 00:49:14.390
Because a Scranton party don't stop.
因为斯克兰顿的派对永不停止。

1042
00:49:15.690 --> 00:49:17.610
It is so great to see you.
很高兴见到你。

1043
00:49:17.770 --> 00:49:19.310
Thank you so much.
非常感谢。

1044
00:49:19.730 --> 00:49:20.490
Are you kidding me?
开什么玩笑？

1045
00:49:20.510 --> 00:49:21.830
It is so great to see you guys.
见到你们太棒了。

1046
00:49:22.510 --> 00:49:23.550
You know how it is.
你们懂的。

1047
00:49:23.750 --> 00:49:27.350
You do a show with somebody, and then you don't overlap again.
你跟某些人合作过一部剧，然后就再也没有交集了。

1048
00:49:27.390 --> 00:49:31.010
And I'm in Nashville now, so I haven't been able to see you guys ever since then.
我现在住在纳什维尔，所以从那以后就再也没能见到你们。

1049
